    "en": "[Micro-turns]\n- Declaration against AI life rights → acceptance of dialogue (rigidity → alignment)\n- Utterance of ‘standard’ → awareness of invalidated emotion (numbness → noticing)\n- Wall’s safety claim → confession of shallow breath (armor → sign)\n- Childhood discipline → ‘a body that can ask’ (discipline → breath)",
